      },
      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Room-temperature χT is 91 emu K mol−1 and falls slowly until about 10 K, then more rapidly. Magnetization at 2 K reaches 64 NμB at 7 T without saturation. The magnetocaloric entropy change is 32.6 J kg−1 K−1 for ΔH = 0–7 T at 2 K, among the highest values then reported for 3d–4f clusters.",
        "measurements": [
